docs {
  # Add Group Member (`AddGroupMember`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.AddGroupMember` in [group_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/group_handler.go)
  **Route**: `POST /api/_private/v1/groups/:groupId/members/:userId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Adds a specified user into the group:
  - Verifies whether user is already enrolled as a member in the group.
  - Links the user record and saves member association with default role `"MEMBER"`.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `groupId` (string, path parameter): Target Group ID.
  - `userId` (string, path parameter): ID of the user being added.
}
